    <briefdescription>
<para>Blob Storage Manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Orchestrates multiple blob storage backends and automatically selects the appropriate backend based on blob size and configuration.</para>
<para>Selection Strategy:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&lt; inline_threshold_bytes: INLINE (stored in RocksDB)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&lt; rocksdb_blob_threshold_bytes: ROCKSDB_BLOB (RocksDB BlobDB)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&gt;= rocksdb_blob_threshold_bytes: External backend (Filesystem/S3/Azure/WebDAV)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
